---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Questions · Direct Lifestyle Medicine" active="questions">

  <section class="page-title">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Questions</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="faq-group" id="model">
        <h2>The practice</h2>
        <div class="faq">
          <details>
            <summary>What is lifestyle medicine?</summary>
            <p class="a">Medical care that treats food, activity, sleep,
            stress, alcohol, tobacco, and relationships as part of
            treatment.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Is this just health coaching?</summary>
            <p class="a">No. I diagnose, test, prescribe, and treat.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Do I need another primary care doctor?</summary>
            <p class="a">No. If you have one, I work with them.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Is this health insurance?</summary>
            <p class="a">No. Keep your insurance for labs, medicines,
            specialists, and hospitals.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>How long are visits?</summary>
            <p class="a">As long as needed. The first visit is up to 90
            minutes.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-group" id="money">
        <h2>Cost</h2>
        <div class="faq">
          <details>
            <summary>What else will I pay?</summary>
            <p class="a">Nothing to me. Labs, imaging, medicines,
            specialists, and hospitals bill you or your insurance.
            Procedure supplies are passed through at cost, stated
            first. No fees for forms or missed visits.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Can I join on Medicare or Medicaid?</summary>
            <p class="a">Not settled yet. Ask me. I do not bill Medicare,
            Medicaid, or any insurer.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Can I use an HSA or FSA?</summary>
            <p class="a">Not settled yet. Ask your tax advisor.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What if I can&rsquo;t afford $99?</summary>
            <p class="a">Reduced and free memberships are available, with
            the same care. Ask me.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-group" id="availability">
        <h2>Availability</h2>
        <div class="faq">
          <details>
            <summary>How fast do you answer messages?</summary>
            <p class="a">Within 1&ndash;2 business days. Do not use messages
            for urgent problems.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What about nights, weekends, and emergencies?</summary>
            <p class="a">I keep business hours. Emergencies: call 911.
            Urgent and I&rsquo;m unavailable: urgent care.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What happens when you are away?</summary>
            <p class="a">You get notice. I still check results and
            messages, and refills are arranged first.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-group" id="medicine">
        <h2>Medical care</h2>
        <div class="faq">
          <details>
            <summary>What do you treat?</summary>
            <p class="a">See <a href="/help">What I help with</a>. Some
            conditions need a specialist leading.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What is your training?</summary>
            <p class="a">M.D., Texas A&amp;M. Internal medicine
            internship, George Washington University. I did not complete
            a residency. Lifestyle medicine board certification in
            progress.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Do you prescribe controlled medicines?</summary>
            <p class="a">Yes, under a written policy, including ADHD
            medicines. Some require in-person visits. If you mainly want a
            specific controlled prescription, this is probably not the
            right fit.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-group" id="starting">
        <h2>Joining and leaving</h2>
        <div class="faq">
          <details>
            <summary>How do I join?</summary>
            <p class="a">After the free conversation, sign the agreement
            and set up payment. The first visit is usually within two
            weeks.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Is there a contract?</summary>
            <p class="a">No. Cancel anytime, effective at the end of the
            month.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What happens to my records if I leave?</summary>
            <p class="a">You get a free electronic copy. Prescriptions are
            bridged up to 90 days where safe.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Can my family join?</summary>
            <p class="a">Each adult joins separately. Adults only.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta-band">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="inner">
        <a class="btn btn-inverse" href="/book">Book a free conversation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
